OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785190687
OL,3,CKing Charles' most senior courtier to
OL,4,Cleave Buckingham Palace
OL,6,FThe most senior courtier in the royal
OL,7,Fhousehold has announced he is standing
OL,8,Fdown from his role, leaving King
OL,9,FCharles with a significant new
OL,10,Fappointment to make.
OL,12,FSir Clive Alderton is the principal
OL,13,Fprivate secretary to King Charles and
OL,14,FQueen Camilla, and has been with the
OL,15,Fsenior royals for 11 years, making him
OL,16,Fone of the most consequential and
OL,17,Fpowerful courtiers in modern royal
OL,18,Fhistory.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785190687
OL,3,CKing Charles' most senior courtier to
OL,4,Cleave Buckingham Palace
OL,6,FHe oversaw the planning for the
OL,7,Faccession following the death of Queen
OL,8,FElizabeth, and chaired the committee
OL,9,Fwhich organised the first coronation
OL,10,Fin the UK for 70 years.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FSir Clive is a career diplomat, and
OL,18,Fthe King has heavily relied upon his
OL,19,Fadvice and guidance during his time as
OL,20,FPrince of Wales and, in the last four
OL,21,Fyears, as monarch.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785190687
OL,3,CKing Charles' most senior courtier to
OL,4,Cleave Buckingham Palace
OL,6,FBut he is also one of the "men in grey
OL,7,Fsuits" criticised by Prince Harry who,
OL,8,Fin his memoir Spare, referred to Sir
OL,9,FClive as "The Wasp" (the late Queen's
OL,10,Fprivate secretary was "The Bee" and
OL,11,FPrince William's was "The Fly").
OL,13,FThe Duke of Sussex almost
OL,14,Fsinglehandedly blames Sir Clive for
OL,15,Fthe lack of security he gets when he
OL,16,Fis in the UK.
OL,26,@nD@[OUoD@FO]qD@JOUqD@SO]rD@WOUrD@_O]sD@
OL,26,AVOUsD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785190687
OL,3,CKing Charles' most senior courtier to
OL,4,Cleave Buckingham Palace
OL,6,FThe King's private secretary is one of
OL,7,Fthree members of the Royal Household
OL,8,Fwho sit on the Home Office's Royal and
OL,9,FVIP Executive Committee (RAVEC), which
OL,10,Fdecides on the level of protection for
OL,11,Fsenior royals and political figures.
OL,13,FHarry believes Sir Clive convinced
OL,14,FKing Charles that giving him publicly-
OL,15,Ffunded protection would amount to him
OL,16,Fhaving a "half-in/half-out" royal role
OL,17,Fthat the late Queen vehemently opposed.
OL,26,@xD@JOUxD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785190687
OL,3,CKing Charles' most senior courtier to
OL,4,Cleave Buckingham Palace
OL,6,FThe announcement of his departure next
OL,7,Fyear was made to staff in the
OL,8,FHousehold earlier today and it will
OL,9,Fcoincide with Sir Clive's 60th
OL,10,Fbirthday.
OL,12,FIn a memo to courtiers and staff, Sir
OL,13,FClive wrote: "It has been the greatest
OL,14,Fimaginable honour to serve The King
OL,15,Fand Queen in my present role through
OL,16,Fsuch historic times and with
OL,17,Funforgettable humour along the way.
OL,19,F"That support will continue, in a less
OL,20,Fformal capacity, for all of my life."
OL,26,@|D@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785190687
OL,3,CKing Charles' most senior courtier to
OL,4,Cleave Buckingham Palace
OL,6,FIt suggests the King will be able to
OL,7,Fcall on his advice when required even
OL,8,Fafter he has left the road, which is
OL,9,Fnot unusual for senior members of
OL,10,FBuckingham Palace and Kensington
OL,11,FPalace.
OL,13,FSir Clive has been with the Royal
OL,14,FFamily for 20 years and spent 11 of
OL,15,Fthose as the right-hand man to Charles.
OL,17,FIt is a job for which he received a
OL,18,Ftotal pay package of #305,000 in 2025/
OL,19,F26.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785190687
OL,3,CKing Charles' most senior courtier to
OL,4,Cleave Buckingham Palace
OL,6,FIn his role as private secretary,
OL,7,FClive was visible just a week ago when
OL,8,Fhe was filmed in the quadrangle of
OL,9,FBuckingham Palace welcoming outgoing
OL,10,Fprime minister Sir Keir Starmer and
OL,11,Fhis replacement, Andy Burnham, for
OL,12,Ftheir respective private audiences
OL,13,Fwith the King.
OL,15,FHe will also have helped draft and
OL,16,Fcurate major speeches like the one
OL,17,FKing Charles gave to the joint houses
OL,18,Fof Congress in Washington DC on his
OL,19,Fstate visit to the USA in the spring.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785190687
OL,3,CKing Charles' most senior courtier to
OL,4,Cleave Buckingham Palace
OL,6,FSir Clive was on attachment to the
OL,7,FRoyal Household from the Foreign
OL,8,FOffice which he joined in 1986.
OL,10,FHe served overseas in Poland,
OL,11,FSingapore and Belgium, and was the
OL,12,FUK's Ambassador to Morocco prior to
OL,13,Fbecoming Charles and Camilla's private
OL,14,Fsecretary.
OL,16,FAs the key courtier during the first
OL,17,Fyear's of King Charles' reign, he has
OL,18,Fbeen at his side for all the big
OL,19,F"firsts".
OL,26,@{D@AOU{D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785190687
OL,3,CKing Charles' most senior courtier to
OL,4,Cleave Buckingham Palace
OL,6,FThese include the first state visit
OL,7,Foverseas; first visit to a
OL,8,FCommonwealth country; first visit to a
OL,9,Frealm, where the King remains Head of
OL,10,FState; first incoming state visits;
OL,11,Ffirst meetings with Donald Trump, and
OL,12,Fthe first Christmas broadcast to the
OL,13,FNation.
OL,15,FHaving such a powerful role during a
OL,16,Ftime of turmoil in the Royal Family
OL,17,Fmeant he made some enemies, most
OL,18,Fnotably in Prince Harry.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785190687
OL,3,CKing Charles' most senior courtier to
OL,4,Cleave Buckingham Palace
OL,6,FHarry explained why he called Sir
OL,7,FClive "The Wasp" in his book, stating
OL,8,Fthat Sir Clive was "self-effacing" and
OL,9,Fif he "put you on his list", he would
OL,10,Flater "give you such a stab with his
OL,11,Foutsized stinger that you'd cry out in
OL,12,Fconfusion. Where the f*** did that
OL,13,Fcome from?"
OL,15,FIt is understood that Sir Clive's
OL,16,Fsuccessor will be in place by late
OL,17,FSpring 2027.
OL,26,@oD@GOUoD@PO]pD@TOUpD@bO]qD@GOUqD@[O]rD@
OL,26,AGOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30811
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785190687
OL,3,CKing Charles' most senior courtier to
OL,4,Cleave Buckingham Palace
OL,6,FA palace spokesperson said the King
OL,7,Fand Queen are "deeply grateful to
OL,8,FClive for his tireless support and
OL,9,Fwise counsel over the years, and for
OL,10,Fthe enduring loyalty that will ensure
OL,11,Fa smooth transition to his successor".
OL,13,FThis is the Talking Royals - our
OL,14,Fweekly podcast about the Royal Family,
OL,15,Fwith ITV News Royal Editor Chris Ship
OL,16,Fand Producer Lizzie Robinson.
